; ions.mdp — Preprocessing for genion (PrP)
; ===========================================
; System: Human prion protein structured domain PrP(125–228)
; Force field: CHARMM36m / CHARMM-modified TIP3P
;
; STRUCTURE SELECTION AND PREPARATION:
; Unlike Aβ peptides, PrP has a well-defined globular fold:
;   • 3 α-helices: H1 (144–154), H2 (173–194), H3 (200–228)
;   • 2 β-strands: S1 (128–131), S2 (161–164), forming a short
;     antiparallel sheet
;   • 1 disulfide bond: Cys179–Cys214 (stabilizes H2–H3 interface)
;
; RECOMMENDED PDB STRUCTURES:
;   PDB 1QLX — Human PrP(125–228), NMR in acetate buffer pH 4.5
;              20 conformers; use Model 1 (fewest violations)
;   PDB 2LSB — Human PrP(90–230), NMR at pH 4.5
;              Includes the unstructured region 90–124 (optional)
;   PDB 1QM0 — Human PrP(125–228), NMR at pH 7.0
;              Physiological pH — arguably better starting point
;
; For teaching purposes, use PDB 1QLX or 1QM0 (structured domain only).
; If students want to study the disordered N-terminal tail, use 2LSB
; and apply IDP-like box sizing (1.5 nm padding) for that region.
;
; DISULFIDE BOND HANDLING:
; The Cys179–Cys214 disulfide bond is ESSENTIAL for PrP^C stability.
; GROMACS pdb2gmx detects it automatically if:
;   1. The Sγ–Sγ distance is < 0.3 nm in the PDB
;   2. No HG atoms are present on these cysteines
; Verify by checking the topology for CYS2 residue type (not CYS)
; and a [bonds] entry connecting SG atoms across residues.
;
; HISTIDINE RESIDUES IN PrP(125–228):
; Depending on the construct: His140, His155, His177, His187
; At pH 7.4, use HSE (Nε-protonated, neutral) for all.
; At pH 4.5 (matching NMR conditions), consider HSP (doubly protonated,
; +1 charge) for residues with predicted pKa above 4.5.
; ⚠ DECISION POINT: Choose pH 7.4 for biological relevance, or
; pH 4.5 to match the experimental structure's conditions.

integrator      = steep
emtol           = 1000.0
emstep          = 0.01
nsteps          = 10000

nstlist         = 1
cutoff-scheme   = Verlet
verlet-buffer-tolerance = 0.005
coulombtype     = cutoff
rcoulomb        = 1.0
rvdw            = 1.0
pbc             = xyz
